# Fixture Engine

> A fixture of the site, for `cargo xtask llms`'s tests.

It has two sections of Learn and four pages.

This copy documents Shuyi Engine 0.3.0 at commit [`0123456`](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/commit/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567), of 2026-10-28. It follows the `main` branch and changes with each merge, so a game on a released version reads its version's copy, under *Released versions*. Each page listed under Learn's sections, but the tutorial's, which teaches people from nothing, is also in one file, [llms-full.txt](https://docs.invalid/engine/llms-full.txt): 1626 bytes, about 406 tokens.

## Learn

- [Learn](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/index.md): The fixture's Learn.

## The book

- [The book](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/book/index.md): The fixture's book, a page each.
- [Start](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/book/start/index.md): The first page, with code.
- [Later](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/book/later/index.md)

## The guide

- [The guide](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/guide/index.md)
- [Tips](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/guide/tips/index.md): Weighed before the map, though named after it.
- [The map](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/guide/map/index.md): A page with its files beside it.

## Contract

- [The tool contract](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567/docs/contract.md): the operations an agent, CI or a person runs on a game, each with a typed input and a typed answer, on the command line or over MCP
- [Its schemas, version 2](https://docs.invalid/engine/contract/schemas/v2/index.md): the JSON Schema of each operation's input and answer

## API

- [`shuyi`](https://docs.invalid/engine/api/shuyi/index.html): rustdoc's HTML. The front door.
- [`shuyi_core`](https://docs.invalid/engine/api/shuyi_core/index.html): rustdoc's HTML. The core.
- [`shuyi_window`](https://docs.invalid/engine/api/shuyi_window/index.html): rustdoc's HTML. The backend.

